WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:05.090
- I am honored to welcome her
to the show Elaine Welteroth.

00:00:05.492 --> 00:00:09.240
(audience applauds)

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.480
- Drew Barrymore, is
this really happening?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.770
I'm freaking out right now.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.970
- Okay, so for a little backstory,

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:20.970
Elaine and I first met when
you were a beauty editor

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.203
at Teen Vogue.
- Yes.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.360
And it was love at first sight for me.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.600
- It was love at first sight for me too.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.670
I was really new you at that
point in the beauty game.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.210
I had been doing Cover Girl for years

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:39.610
as a co-creative director, but
you made me feel so welcomed.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:44.010
When we're trying to do
something new it's intimidating

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.300
and the more support and
encouragement you have

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.350
to be reminded, go for it.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.500
So that was something that
I always loved about you.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.720
And then you became the
youngest editor in chief

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.500
in Conde Nast history

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.160
when you became the editor
in chief of Teen Vogue.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.330
- Yeah, but I would actually like to say,

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.000
I'm very proud that I am no longer

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.590
the youngest editor in
chief in Conde Nast history.

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:11.740
There's actually an even
younger black woman,

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.140
who is now the editor
in chief of Teen Vogue,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.870
after I departed that role.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:18.760
She's killing it.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.470
Her name is Lindsay Peoples Wagner.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.860
I think it's so important
we celebrate firsts,

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:26.390
but I think it's so important to remember

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.610
the responsibility is to make sure

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.263
that you're never the last.

00:01:31.906 --> 00:01:34.360
I think you feel that
pressure to make sure

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:39.080
that you do the job in a
way that keeps the door open

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.250
and widens that pipeline.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.170
- So one of the last times I saw you

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.560
was at the Goop panel.

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.440
- Yes.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.780
- In my mind I kept thinking,

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:52.603
what is Elaine's next act going to be?

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:57.360
And I had this divine intervention

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:01.320
and I was like, Elaine Welteroth
is literally going to be

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:05.570
this huge figure on
television, I just know it

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:08.220
because you have so much to offer.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.580
- The fact that I'm sitting

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.870
on the Drew Barrymore Show right now

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.040
and that you're telling me this

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.020
just feels like a weird fever dream.

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.640
I'm like this can't be real.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:21.160
- I'm just excited 'cause it
turns out I'm totally psychic.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.400
I'm not kidding, I saw you, I was like,

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.170
she's gonna be a big talk show host.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:29.380
And I just think it's the
perfect Elaine Welteroth fit.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:32.700
- Well, I think it's the perfect
Drew Barrymore fit as well.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.360
- I did not have a psychic
moment about myself.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.098
I can't believe I'm here.

00:02:37.098 --> 00:02:39.190
That one I wouldn't have guessed.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:44.190
- I'm so beyond like
mind blown and honored

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.940
and it still doesn't even feel real

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.767
that I'm going to have
this opportunity as well

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:53.300
to just have conversations that matter,

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.790
to cultivate connection every single day

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.313
on national television.

00:03:00.301 --> 00:03:04.925
I'm so over the moon and so
grateful to have that chance.

00:03:04.925 --> 00:03:05.990
So it's exciting.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.060
And I'm grateful that you,

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.140
I can't believe you're tellin'
me you had this vision.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.350
- I not only had the vision,

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:14.500
but then you were doing some
fun stuff on Kelly and Ryan.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.540
And I was like, this, this,
I'm not kidding, like I-

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.020
- I will tell you that day,

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:23.830
I remember seeing you at the
panel, it was the Goop panel

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:27.130
and Gwyneth Paltrow was up
there and had us all together.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.730
It was such a scary time for me.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.520
I had decided I was leaving Teen Vogue

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:36.080
and I had this big vision
in my mind about what I saw

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.890
but no one else did.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.710
But I knew even at that point,

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:44.710
I thought like the worst
thing would be to feel stuck

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.200
in an identity that someone else

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:52.200
or that the world put me in,
like a box that I was put in.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:57.350
- I was nervous to try and
get into a beauty game.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:01.740
Nothing compared to my fear
about starting this job.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:05.960
And it's changed me in ways
I could have never expected.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:07.950
It's gonna be honestly I think,

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.840
one of the most important
years of my entire life

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:14.690
and listen, you're on
"The Talk", I'm on here.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:19.030
We're a CBS Studios-owned
show, you're CBS.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:22.830
We were sisters in beauty
and may we be sisters

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:26.030
in the talk show world,
because you are someone

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.090
that is one of my favorite,

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:30.980
you're just one of my favorite people.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.120
So let's be sisters in talk shows.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.290
- Let's be sisters, yes.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.470
- I just wanna congratulate CBS

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.920
for making one of its smartest decisions.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:42.753
- Thank you.

00:04:42.753 --> 00:04:44.034
I just have no words.

00:04:44.034 --> 00:04:47.100
You have made me for the first
time in my life, speechless.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:47.933
So thank you.

00:04:47.933 --> 00:04:48.780
- That takes a lot.
- And you made

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.010
a brown girl blush.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.740
- I'm gonna get up and
give you a virtual hug.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.697
- Yes, you know what? I have a hug.

00:04:54.697 --> 00:04:56.500
Oh, oh, oh, my neck thingy.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:57.370
- Are you stuck here?

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.240
That's okay, I'll come to you.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.240
There we go.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.410
- Wait, wait, oh my God.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.710
- I can never line up.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:06.150
Now I've got my arms crawling
out of the back of you.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:09.310
- Wait Drew, we have to
do my quarantine hug.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.280
Are you ready?

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.268
- I am ready, teach me Elaine.

00:05:12.268 --> 00:05:13.283
- Okay, turn around.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.030
Come closer to me, let's connect butts.

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.930
Okay, yes, and then we just go like this.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:21.080
(audience laughs)

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:21.913
- I love it.

00:05:21.913 --> 00:05:24.300
- This is my quarantine hug
for all the people I love

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.362
that I can't touch.

00:05:25.362 --> 00:05:28.029
(upbeat music)

